        (263, new[]
        {
            "Thank you for freeing me. I am a dissident. I said out loud that the Dark Monk's priests want the Cup's wish for themselves, and the stewards locked me up for it. @ But let's not waste any time. If you want to get out of here, don't take the main entrance, it is being watched by soldiers.",
